WEBVTT

01:05:58.919 --> 01:06:00.075
You fall into yourself,

01:06:00.099 --> 01:06:02.302
and you really live
at the level of your heart,

01:06:02.326 --> 01:06:04.252
which yearns for the fusion with others,

01:06:04.276 --> 01:06:05.563
and the level of your soul,

01:06:05.587 --> 01:06:07.794
which years for fusion
with some ultimate good.

01:06:07.818 --> 01:06:10.262
And people who have taken
the bigger journey of life

01:06:10.286 --> 01:06:11.660
have fallen into themselves,

01:06:11.684 --> 01:06:13.774
and they've discovered the substrate,

01:06:13.798 --> 01:06:15.280
the lowest level of themselves,

01:06:15.304 --> 01:06:18.234
where they find an
illimitable ability to care.

01:06:18.258 --> 01:06:21.033
I have a friend who I quote in the book.

01:06:21.057 --> 01:06:23.020
She said, "When my daughter was born,

01:06:23.044 --> 01:06:26.326
I realized I loved her
more than evolution required."

01:06:26.350 --> 01:06:27.504
CA: Huh.

01:06:27.528 --> 01:06:30.830
DB: There's a level of love and care
that is just completely human,